{"text":"purananuru","n":354,"lines":["அரைசுதலை வரினும் அடங்கல் ஆனா","நிரைகாழ் எ·கம் நீரின் மூழ்கப்","புரையோர் சேர்ந்தெனத் தந்தையும் பெயர்க்கும்","வயல்அமர் கழனி வாயிற் பொய்கைக்","கயலார் நாரை உகைத்த வாளை","புனலாடு மகளிர் வளமனை ஒய்யும்","ஊர்கவின் இழப்பவும் வருவது கொல்லோ","சுணங்கு அணிந்து எழிலிய அணந்துஏந்து இளமுலை","வீங்குஇறைப் பணைத்தோள் மடந்தை","மான்பிணை யன்ன மகிழ்மட நோக்கே"],"tr":["araicutalai variṉum aṭaṅkal āṉā","niraikāḻ ekam nīriṉ mūḻkap","puraiyōr cērnteṉat tantaiyum peyarkkum","vayalamar kaḻaṉi vāyiṟ poykaik","kayalār nārai ukaitta vāḷai","puṉalāṭu makaḷir vaḷamaṉai oyyum","ūrkaviṉ iḻappavum varuvatu kollō","cuṇaṅku aṇintu eḻiliya aṇantuēntu iḷamulai","vīṅkuiṟaip paṇaittōḷ maṭantai","māṉpiṇai yaṉṉa makiḻmaṭa nōkkē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kāñci","tinai_ta":"காஞ்சி","turai_ta":"மகட்பாற் காஞ்சி","poet_ta":"பரணர்","poet_tr":"Paraṇar"},"scan":{"meter":"iṇaikkuṟaḷ āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"10 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"9×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 36, veṇcīr 3"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"veṇṭaḷai 20, āciriyattaḷai 16, kalittaḷai 2"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"அரைசுதலை","tr":"araicutalai","foot":"karuviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அரை","tr":"arai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"சுத","tr":"cuta"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"}]},{"text":"வரினு","tr":"variṉu","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வரி","tr":"vari"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னு","tr":"ṉu"}]},{"text":"மடங்க","tr":"maṭaṅka","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மடங்","tr":"maṭaṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"க","tr":"ka"}]},{"text":"லானா","tr":"lāṉā","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லா","tr":"lā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னா","tr":"ṉā"}]}],[{"text":"நிரைகா","tr":"niraikā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நிரை","tr":"nirai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"}]},{"text":"ழெகம்நீரின்","tr":"ḻekamnī